[al:新概念英语第二册]
[ti:Out of the Darkness]
[00:01.22]Why was the girl in hospital? | 女孩为什么住院了？
[00:14.25]Nearly a week passed before | 将近一个星期过去了
[00:17.04]the girl was able to explain | 女孩才能解释
[00:19.56]what had happened to her. | 发生在她身上的事情。
[00:22.24]One afternoon she set out | 一个下午，她出发了
[00:25.72]from the coast in a small boat | 乘小船从海岸出发
[00:28.26]and was caught in a storm. | 结果遭遇了暴风雨。
[00:30.94]Towards evening, | 傍晚时分，
[00:32.88]the boat struck a rock and | 小船撞上了一块礁石
[00:35.17]the girl jumped into the sea. | 女孩跳入了海中。
[00:37.84]Then she swam to the shore | 然后她游向岸边
[00:40.49]after spending the whole night in the water. | 在水里待了一整夜。
[00:44.52]During that time she covered | 在那段时间里，她游了
[00:47.64]a distance of eight miles. | 八英里的距离。
[00:50.08]Early next morning, | 第二天一早，
[00:52.76]she saw a light ahead. | 她看到前方有灯光。
[00:55.64]She knew she was near the shore | 她知道她靠近岸边了
[00:58.77]because the light was high up on the cliffs. | 因为灯光在高高的悬崖上。
[01:03.04]On arriving at the shore, | 到达岸边后，
[01:05.92]the girl struggled up the cliff towards | 女孩艰难地爬上悬崖
[01:09.66]the light she had seen. | 朝着她看到的灯光。
[01:11.70]That was all she remembered. | 这就是她所记得的一切。
[01:14.73]When she woke up a day later, | 一天后她醒来时，
[01:17.73]she found herself in hospital. | 她发现自己躺在医院里。